      "use": "One family, four weights: Regular 400 body, Medium 500 labels, Semibold 600 UI, Bold 700 headings. Display sizes tighten tracking (-0.035em) and line height (1.04)."
    }
  ],
  "logo": {
    "placement": "free",
    "once_per_frame": true,
    "plate": null,
    "min_height_px": 24,
    "do_not": [
      "recolor or shift the rose-to-orange gradient",
      "stretch or squash",
      "add effects: no shadows, glows, outlines or rotation",
      "place on busy photos (use the white lockup on a calm, darkened area)",
      "crowd it: keep clear space x = the star height (about a quarter of the lockup height)",
      "use on brand colour (the gradient mark disappears on crimson)",
      "set the lockup below 96 px wide or the mark below 16 px"
    ],
    "files": {
      "lockup": "../../../assets/brand/logo.svg",
      "lockup_white": "../../../assets/brand/logo-white.svg",
      "mono": "../../../assets/brand/logo-mono.svg",
      "mark": "../../../assets/brand/logo-mark.svg",
      "icon": "../../../assets/brand/app-icon.svg"
    }
  },
  "motifs": [
    "murmuration: thousands of birds moving as one fluid shape (the brand story)",
    "the flight path: a calligraphic S stroke, hair-thin where it begins, gathering weight, tapering to a point",
    "the four-point star (floats ahead of the stroke; the AI moment)",
    "signature rose-to-orange gradient (#FF2357 to #FE6E00) for display words, the logo, active indicators and progress fills",
    "hairline-bordered cards, 16 px radius, soft elevation; pill buttons and badges",
    "soft rose and orange glows on ink over a faint grid (the sign-in hero)"
  ],
  "voice": "Calm, clear, quietly confident. Plain verbs and specific numbers, no jargon; human (contractions, \"you\"); celebrate the team, not the tool.",
  "guidelines": [
    "../../../brand.html"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "Crimson leads; slate neutrals do most of the work; the gradient is for brand moments only.",
    "Never put small text on the signature gradient; buttons with text use the CTA gradient (#E11D48 to #F0560F), one primary action per screen.",
    "Status always pairs an icon with a label, never colour alone; status colours are never used for a series.",
    "Icons are Lucide at a 1.75 stroke; network glyphs are the official marks on their own brand colour; never emoji as icons.",
    "Charts: one axis, thin marks, legend for two or more series, text in ink not series colour.",
    "Motion: entrances ease out, exits ease in and run about 30% faster; spring easing only for small confirmations.",
    "Dark mode uses its own stepped values (tokens.css dark roles), not an inversion."
  ],
